{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792657714540,"sessionID":"ses_e9d46468fffeHNkM0mgNwFWCkC","part":{"partID":"prt_162b9ca63001TABrCovOE15XRP","sessionID":"ses_e9d46468fffeHNkM0mgNwFWCkC","messageID":"msg_162b9b9d2001s1qv64XW30Ft7G","type":"tool","id":"call_00_ET_giI2CUcJtKIUQi2EjpAu8393","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"/home/baptistefaisy/aiven-kafka-demo/trace-dump d4f8a0b2c6e95f3a0b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c --detectors 2>&1"},"output":"%4|1792657706.300|CONFWARN|rdkafka#consumer-1| [thrd:app]: Configuration property request.timeout.ms is a producer property and will be ignored by this consumer instance\n=== trace d4f8a0b2c6e95f3a0b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c ===\nscenario=db/oom profile=prod error.type=oom\n--- spans (1) ---\n  2026-10-22 07:38:50.196 jvm.heap                  1600.0ms Error  {\"error.type\": \"oom\", \"error.severity\": \"FATAL\", \"exception.message\": \"java.lang.OutOfMemoryError: Java heap space\", \"error.source\": \"postgresql://pg-erreurs/erreurs.app_errors\", \"jvm.gc.pause\": \"1600\", \"exception.type\": \"java.lang.OutOfMemoryError\", \"jvm.memory.max\": \"2147483648\", \"jvm.memory.used\": \"2147483648\", \"http.response.status_code\": \"500\", \"server.address\": \"app-2.prod.internal\", \"db.error.origin\": \"application\", \"db.error.id\": \"4\", \"db.source.table\": \"erreurs.app_errors\"}\n--- logs (1) ---\n  2026-10-22 07:38:50.196 FATAL (sev 21) java.lang.OutOfMemoryError: Java heap space\n--- metriques (1) ---\n  app.errors = 1 [1] {\"agent.scenario\": \"db/oom\", \"agent.profile\": \"prod\", \"error.type\": \"oom\", \"error.severity\": \"FATAL\", \"service.name\": \"agent-demo\"}\n--- detecteurs ---\n  [ok      ] retry_spiral     aucune spirale de retry (> 2 appels)\n  [ok      ] silent_failure   aucune promesse non tenue par l'outil\n  [ok      ] stale_source     aucune version perimee\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"%4|179265